# What the build context does not need, and what it must not carry.
#
# `node_modules` above all: the node stage runs `npm ci` for itself, and a
# host's binaries copied into an alpine image are the wrong platform's. A
# `dist` from somebody's laptop would be served instead of the one the image
# built, which is the whole point of building it here.

.git
.github
.venv
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
